  "body": "Closes #1125\nClaim: cloud/i1125-sonnet\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5 (cloud/i1125-sonnet)\n\n**Problem.** Under a gallery theme the large-title row kept the system card or sat on `surface` (inside `listLookRows()`), while the contrast rule only checks `title` on `background`. The dense look draws row text on `background`, a pair no rule checked. The selection and section header under the list look were untested.\n\n**Cause.** `listLookTitleRow()` only cleared the row in the dense look; `contrastRules` listed `textPrimary`/`textSecondary`/`errorText`/`badgeOutline` on `surface`/`selection` only.\n\n**Change.**\n- `DenseTitleRow`: the title row is clear under a theme in both looks, so `title` is drawn on `background`. Legacy (no theme) unchanged.\n- `ThemeTokens.contrastRules`: `textPrimary`, `textSecondary`, `errorText`, `badgeOutline` on `background`.\n- THEMES.md §3 matches.\n\n**Tests.**\n- `theRulesCoverEveryPairTheAppDraws`: four new pairs; seen red (4 issues) before the rules, green after (`swift test --filter HFRModelsTests`, 235 pass, bundled themes included).\n- Hosted (`ThemedListTests`, not runnable on Linux; needs the Compile check): `theLargeTitleRowIsOnTheBackgroundUnderATheme` (classic + dense: background; Legacy: card) and `aSelectedRowAndASectionUnderTheListLookFollowTheTheme` (`listLookRow(isSelected:)` paints `selection`, a row under a `Section` header paints `surface`).\n- Not covered: Bookmarks' `themedListRow` nested in a `listRowBackground` (modifier order semantics not verifiable without a build); to check on the hosted run.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
